11. Production Design Decisions

Microservices communicate through APIs instead of cross-service JPA relationships.

Account Service owns Account domain logic; Customer Service owns Customer and Customer Address logic.

Environment-specific service URLs remain externalized.

Business exceptions are translated centrally through @RestControllerAdvice.

Timeouts are configured now; retry/circuit breaker behavior will be introduced later with Resilience4j.

Service-to-service authentication will be added during the security phase.

12. Deferred Improvements

The following are deliberately deferred so the project grows in controlled stages: Resilience4j retry and circuit breaker, JWT/OAuth2 service security, API Gateway, Kafka, Redis, Testcontainers/Oracle integration tests, distributed tracing, monitoring, Docker/Kubernetes, AWS deployment, Terraform and CI/CD.

