14. Interview Talking Points

A concise way to explain this work in an interview: Account Service does not access Customer tables directly. During account creation it validates the customer through a REST API, checks business status and duplicate-account rules, and converts downstream network failures into a controlled 503 response. Explicit connect/read timeouts prevent hanging calls. JUnit and Mockito cover success, validation, lifecycle and dependency-failure paths, and the complete Maven reactor is run to prevent cross-module regressions.

